<title>UK: Both Brent dates kept - trade.</title>
<headline>Both Brent dates kept - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Both of the Brent dates nominated from the paper chains were kept ahead of the five o'clock deadline on Monday, traders said.</p>
<p>One of the Jan 28-30 loaders was kept by JP Morgan and the other by Mobil, they said.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 5387</p>
